OL,3,GNEWSAAsda licence bid lodged for empty
OL,4,ABroad Marsh units
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsda is a step closer to opening an
OL,7,FExpress store in long-vacant units at
OL,8,Fone of Nottingham's high-profile
OL,9,Fdevelopments.
OL,11,FThe rebuilt Broad Marsh car park opened
OL,12,Fin 2021, followed by the new bus
OL,13,Fstation a year later and Central
OL,14,FLibrary in 2023, all within the same
OL,15,Fblock.
OL,17,FGround-floor retail units facing the
OL,18,Fnewly pedestrianised Carrington Street,
OL,19,Fwhich also form part of the complex,
OL,20,Fhad stood empty until a cafe opened in
OL,21,FDecember last year.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
