OL,3,GNEWSAAsda licence bid lodged for empty
OL,4,ABroad Marsh units
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe same month, Asda confirmed it was
OL,7,Fplanning to open a store in the
OL,8,Fremaining space, and now planning
OL,9,Fdocuments show it is asking for the
OL,10,Fpremises licence to start on 30
OL,11,FOctober.
